    <bpmn:process id="W_W557" name="W557. E-Commerce Abandoned Cart Recovery &amp; Retargeting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cart abandonment event (customer adds items to cart but does not complete checkout within 30 minutes)
Frequency: Continuous, ~15,000–20,000 abandoned carts per month (~25–32% of all carts initiated)
Volume: Higher during promotional periods (3x during 11.11, 12.12, Payday Sales); BOPIS carts have lower abandonment (15%) vs. home delivery (50%)
Owner: Digital Marketing Manager / E-Commerce Manager
Participants: Digital Marketing Specialist, E-Commerce Manager, CRM Analyst (C for segmentation), Content Designer (C for email templates)
Source: workflow W557 — E-Commerce Abandoned Cart Recovery &amp; Retargeting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W557_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W557_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W557_Lane2" name="Digital Marketing Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W557_Lane3" name="CRM Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W557_End18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W557_Start5" name="Cart abandonment event (customer adds items to cart but does not complete checkout within…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task6" name="Cart abandonment detected by e-commerce platform (30-minute inactivity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cart abandonment detected by e-commerce platform (30-minute inactivity threshold; excluded: carts under PHP 500, guest checkouts without email/mobile)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task7" name="System checks customer consent (RA 10173 per W405 privacy master) — only…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System checks customer consent (RA 10173 per W405 privacy master) — only enrolled loyalty members or registered customers with marketing consent receive recovery communications
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task8" name="First touch (1 hour after abandonment)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: First touch (1 hour after abandonment): personalized push notification via BuildRight app or SMS — &quot;Your cart is waiting! Items in [category] are selling fast.&quot;
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Specialist
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task9" name="Second touch (6 hours)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Second touch (6 hours): email with cart summary, item images, and personalized message — &quot;Still thinking about it? Your [item names] are reserved for 24 hours.&quot;
Responsible (R): System / Content Designer
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task10" name="Third touch (24 hours, if cart still abandoned)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Third touch (24 hours, if cart still abandoned): email with incentive offer — (a) Free shipping if cart &gt; PHP 3,000, or (b) 5% discount code (single-use, 48-hour validity), or (c) loyalty bonus points (2x earning for 7 days)
Responsible (R): System / Content Designer
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task11" name="Incentive rules engine applies customer-segment-specific offers: new customers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Incentive rules engine applies customer-segment-specific offers: new customers get discount, returning customers get free shipping, VIP members get double points; segment data sourced from CDP (W156)
Responsible (R): System / CRM Analyst
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task12" name="Retargeting ad activation: abandoned product SKUs added to Facebook/Meta and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Retargeting ad activation: abandoned product SKUs added to Facebook/Meta and Google Display Network retargeting pool per W83 campaign management
Responsible (R): System / Digital Marketing Specialist
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Manager
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W557_Task13" name="Recovery tracking: if customer completes purchase from recovery communication…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Recovery tracking: if customer completes purchase from recovery communication, attribute conversion to recovery sequence in analytics; log recovery touchpoint (first, second, third) and incentive type used
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Specialist
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W557_Task14" name="Weekly unrecovered cart analysis: review top abandoned categories and SKUs —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Weekly unrecovered cart analysis: review top abandoned categories and SKUs — identify root causes (high shipping cost, out-of-stock, pricing, checkout friction); feed findings into UX improvement backlog
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Specialist / CRM Analyst
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W557_Task15" name="Monthly recovery performance dashboard: recovery rate by touch point, incentive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Monthly recovery performance dashboard: recovery rate by touch point, incentive cost vs. revenue recovered, abandoned cart trend, top abandoned SKUs
Responsible (R): CRM Analyst
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Manager
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W557_Task16" name="Quarterly optimization: A/B test subject lines, timing, incentive types; update…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: Quarterly optimization: A/B test subject lines, timing, incentive types; update recovery sequence based on results; adjust segment-specific offers based on conversion data
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Specialist / CRM Analyst
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 6 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W557_Task17" name="Annual recovery program ROI calculation feeding into W565 (marketing ROI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 12: Annual recovery program ROI calculation feeding into W565 (marketing ROI analysis): total recovered revenue, total incentive cost, net incremental revenue, recovery rate trend
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Specialist
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: 4 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W557_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W557_End18" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W557_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W557_Annotation19">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-269 (ensure controlled execution — Ecommerce Platform Operations (PA-10.1).) | - operational: Digital Marketing Manager / E-Commerce Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Digital Marketing Manager / E-Commerce Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
