    <bpmn:process id="W_W934" name="W934. Ecommerce Customer Wishlist, Save-for-Later &amp; Price Drop Alert" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer adds a product to their wishlist or saves an item from their cart for later on buildright.com.ph or the mobile app
Frequency: ~60,000–100,000 wishlist items added/month; ~25,000–40,000 unique customers with active wishlists
Volume: Average 3–5 items per wishlist; ~15% of wishlist items purchased within 90 days
Owner: Ecommerce Merchandiser
Participants: Customer, Ecommerce Merchandiser, Pricing Analyst
Source: workflow W934 — Ecommerce Customer Wishlist, Save-for-Later &amp; Price Drop Alert</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W934_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W934_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W934_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W934_Lane3" name="Ecommerce Merchandiser">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W934_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W934_Start5" name="Customer adds a product to their wishlist or saves an item from their cart for later on…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W934_Task6" name="Customer browses buildright.com.ph or mobile app and adds products to wishlist…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer browses buildright.com.ph or mobile app and adds products to wishlist by clicking the heart/save icon on product cards or product detail pages; customer can also save items from their shopping cart (&quot;Save for Later&quot; button) which moves the item from cart to wishlist
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 sec/item</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W934_Task7" name="System creates wishlist entry: SKU, customer identifier (loyalty account or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System creates wishlist entry: SKU, customer identifier (loyalty account or guest session), added date, added price (current price at time of saving), preferred store/location (for ATP display); wishlist stored in customer&#x27;s account (loyalty members) or session (guests, expires with session)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W934_Task8" name="Customer&#x27;s wishlist page displays all saved items with: current price, price at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer&#x27;s wishlist page displays all saved items with: current price, price at time of saving (with visual indicator if price has changed — green if lower, red if higher), real-time ATP at preferred store, &quot;Add to Cart&quot; button, &quot;Remove&quot; button, and &quot;Share Wishlist&quot; button
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: On demand</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W934_Task9" name="When a price change is applied to a SKU that exists on active wishlists…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: When a price change is applied to a SKU that exists on active wishlists (regular price change per W40, promotional activation per W13, or markdown per W93): system identifies affected wishlists and queues price drop notifications
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W934_Task10" name="System sends price drop notification to affected customers (within 24 hours of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System sends price drop notification to affected customers (within 24 hours of price change): email with product image, original saved price vs. new price, savings amount, &quot;Add to Cart&quot; button, and direct link; push notification via mobile app for loyalty members; notifications batched per customer (max 1 email per day with all price drops consolidated)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W934_Task11" name="Customer shares wishlist via &quot;Share Wishlist&quot; button: generates a shareable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Customer shares wishlist via &quot;Share Wishlist&quot; button: generates a shareable link (view-only) or sends directly via email, SMS, or messaging app (Viber, WhatsApp, Messenger — popular in Philippines); shared wishlist displays products with current prices but no customer account information; useful for home renovation projects where family members or contractors need to see the material list
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W934_Task12" name="Monthly: Ecommerce Merchandiser reviews wishlist analytics dashboard — top…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly: Ecommerce Merchandiser reviews wishlist analytics dashboard — top wishlisted SKUs (demand signal), wishlist-to-purchase conversion rate, average wishlist age, price drop notification click-through rate, share rate, category distribution of wishlisted items; identifies high-wishlist-low-purchase SKUs for pricing or availability investigation
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Merchandiser
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W934_Task13" name="Quarterly: Ecommerce Merchandiser shares top wishlisted out-of-stock items with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly: Ecommerce Merchandiser shares top wishlisted out-of-stock items with Supply Planning for demand signal; shares high-wishlist-low-conversion items with Pricing Analyst for competitive price review (W130); incorporates wishlist data into seasonal buying plan (W32) as forward demand indicator
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Merchandiser
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W934_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W934_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W934_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W934_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-269 (ensure controlled execution — Ecommerce Platform Operations (PA-10.1).) | - operational: Ecommerce Merchandiser review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Merchandiser</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
