    <bpmn:process id="W_W1185" name="W1185. Post-Purchase Review Solicitation, Loyalty Review Incentives &amp; Fake-Review Detection" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post-delivery review-solicitation cycle (7 days after delivery); or fake-review pattern alert; or scheduled monthly detection review
Frequency: ~2,000–3,000 solicited reviews/month; ~10–20 fake-review investigations/month
Volume: 35,000 active SKUs; target ≥ 30% of sold SKUs with ≥ 1 review within 12 months
Owner: Ecommerce Content Moderator
Participants: Ecommerce Content Moderator, Category Manager, Customer Service, Legal (for defamatory content)
Source: workflow W1185 — Post-Purchase Review Solicitation, Loyalty Review Incentives &amp; Fake-Review Detection</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1185_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1185_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1185_Lane2" name="Ecommerce Content Moderator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1185_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1185_Start4" name="Post-delivery review-solicitation cycle (7 days after delivery); or fake-review pattern…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1185_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1185_Task5" name="Review solicitation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Review solicitation: (a) system automatically emails customers 7 days after product delivery requesting review; (b) email includes direct link to product review form; (c) review form: star rating (1–5), review title, review text, optional photo upload; (d) loyalty incentive: 50 loyalty points (PHP 5 equivalent) for verified purchase review submitted within 30 days; (e) for in-store purchases: review solicitation via mobile app per W615 with receipt scan verification
Responsible (R): System / Customer
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1185_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1185_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1185_Task6" name="Moderation hand-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Moderation hand-off: submitted reviews flow into the canonical W510 verification and auto-publication pipeline (W510 steps 2–4); flagged content enters the manual queue governed by W510 with the W1286 moderation-playbook checks — this workflow takes no moderation action itself
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1185_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1185_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1185_Task7" name="Fake review detection">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fake review detection: (a) system flags potential fake reviews: (i) multiple reviews from same IP, (ii) reviewer account created same day, (iii) identical text across products, (iv) surge of 5-star reviews for new product; (b) Content Moderator investigates; (c) confirmed fake: reject and block account; (d) pattern for specific vendor: escalate to Category Manager
Responsible (R): System / Ecommerce Content Moderator
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: 15 min/flagged review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1185_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1185_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1185_Task8" name="Negative-review hand-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Negative-review hand-off: ≤2-star reviews auto-create the W510 CX ticket and public response (W510 steps 5–6), with quality-pattern escalation per W1311; this workflow contributes only the fake-pattern flags from step 3(d)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1185_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1185_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1185_Task9" name="Solicitation performance analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Solicitation performance analytics: monthly review-generation funnel — % of delivered orders solicited, % solicited → submitted, incentive cost per published review, and coverage vs the 30%-of-sold-SKUs target; quarterly: share coverage insights with top-20 vendors per W705 (rating/category analytics governance per W510 step 7 and W1311 step 5)
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Content Moderator / BI Analyst
Accountable (A): GM, Digital Commerce Inc.
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1185_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1185_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1185_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1185_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1185_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-269 (ensure controlled execution — Ecommerce Platform Operations (PA-10.1).) | - operational: Ecommerce Content Moderator review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Content Moderator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1185_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1185_Annotation11" targetRef="W1185_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1185_Flow13" sourceRef="W1185_Start4" targetRef="W1185_Task5" />
