    <bpmn:process id="W_W1242" name="W1242. E-Commerce B2B Corporate Punchout Catalog &amp; Procurement Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Corporate/institutional customer requests punchout catalog integration with their e-procurement system
Frequency: ~5–10 new punchout setup requests/year; ongoing transaction processing for active integrations
Volume: ~200 corporate accounts; ~10–15 with punchout capability; ~50–100 punchout orders/month
Owner: Ecommerce Platform Manager
Participants: Ecommerce Platform Manager, IT – Integration, B2B Sales Manager, Corporate Customer IT, Finance – AR
Source: workflow W1242 — E-Commerce B2B Corporate Punchout Catalog &amp; Procurement Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1242_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1242_Lane1" name="B2B Sales Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1242_Lane2" name="IT – Integration">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1242_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1242_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1242_Start5" name="Corporate/institutional customer requests punchout catalog integration with their…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1242_Task6" name="Customer requirement gathering">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer requirement gathering: B2B Sales Manager collects customer requirements: (a) customer&#x27;s e-procurement platform and version; (b) punchout protocol (cXML or OCI); (c) authentication method; (d) contract pricing rules and product catalog scope; (e) order routing (direct to store, DC, or job site per W19); (f) invoice format requirements (electronic, cXML, EDI)
Responsible (R): B2B Sales Manager
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Platform Manager
Duration: 2–4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1242_Task7" name="Technical integration setup">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Technical integration setup: IT – Integration configures punchout: (a) set up cXML/OCI endpoint on BuildRight ecommerce platform; (b) configure authentication (shared secret or certificate-based); (c) map customer&#x27;s contract pricing from W163 to punchout catalog; (d) restrict catalog to contracted items (hide non-contracted SKUs); (e) configure return URL and cart transfer protocol
Responsible (R): IT – Integration
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Platform Manager
Duration: 8–16 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1242_Task8" name="Testing &amp; certification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Testing &amp; certification: (a) perform end-to-end test: punchout from customer&#x27;s system → browse catalog → add items to cart → return cart to procurement system; (b) verify pricing matches contract; (c) verify item details (description, UOM, images); (d) test error scenarios (item out of stock, pricing changed); (e) customer IT team certifies integration
Responsible (R): IT – Integration / Customer IT
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Platform Manager
Duration: 4–8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1242_Task9" name="Go-live &amp; user training">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Go-live &amp; user training: (a) activate punchout for customer; (b) train customer&#x27;s procurement users on how to access BuildRight catalog via punchout; (c) provide BuildRight contact for support issues; (d) B2B Sales Manager communicates go-live to customer procurement team
Responsible (R): B2B Sales Manager
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Platform Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1242_Task10" name="Ongoing transaction processing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Ongoing transaction processing: System handles punchout orders automatically: (a) customer punches out → browses catalog with contract pricing → adds to cart → returns to procurement system; (b) after approval in customer system: order transmitted to BuildRight ecommerce as standard order; (c) fulfillment per W534 multi-origin orchestration; (d) invoice generated per customer requirements and transmitted electronically
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Platform Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1242_Task11" name="Quarterly integration health check">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Quarterly integration health check: (a) review transaction volume and error rates; (b) update catalog for new/discontinued items; (c) refresh contract pricing per W163; (d) address any technical issues reported by customer; (e) review with B2B Sales Manager for upsell opportunities
Responsible (R): IT – Integration / B2B Sales Manager
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Platform Manager
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1242_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1242_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1242_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1242_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-269 (ensure controlled execution — Ecommerce Platform Operations (PA-10.1).) | - operational: Ecommerce Platform Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Platform Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1242_Assoc14" sourceRef="W1242_Annotation13" targetRef="W1242_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1242_Flow15" sourceRef="W1242_Start5" targetRef="W1242_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1242_Flow16" sourceRef="W1242_Task6" targetRef="W1242_Task7" />
