    <bpmn:process id="W_W1286" name="W1286. Ecommerce UGC Moderation Playbook, Content Seeding &amp; Product Q&amp;A Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer submits product review, rating, photo, or video on ecommerce platform; or customer submits a product question
Frequency: ~2,000–3,000 new reviews/month (~400–600 entering the manual queue at the ~20% flag rate, step 1); ~10–20 new-product seeding launches/quarter; Q&amp;A ad-hoc
Volume: ~2,000–3,000 reviews/month across 35,000 SKU catalog (aligned to the canonical W510 volume)
Owner: Ecommerce Content Moderator
Participants: Ecommerce Content Moderator, Ecommerce Operations, Category Manager, Customer
Source: workflow W1286 — Ecommerce UGC Moderation Playbook, Content Seeding &amp; Product Q&amp;A Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1286_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1286_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1286_Lane2" name="Ecommerce Content Moderator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1286_Lane3" name="Ecommerce Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1286_Lane4" name="Department Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1286_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1286_Start6" name="Customer submits product review, rating, photo, or video on ecommerce platform; or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1286_Task7" name="Automated content screening">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Automated content screening: System performs automated pre-moderation on all submitted content: (a) profanity and inappropriate language filter, (b) spam detection (duplicate content, promotional links, competitor URLs), (c) image classification for inappropriate content, (d) sentiment analysis flagging for potential safety/legal issues; auto-publishes content that passes all filters; flags ~20% for human review
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1286_Task8" name="Manual moderation queue">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Manual moderation queue: Ecommerce Content Moderator reviews flagged submissions: (a) verify review is for correct product (customers sometimes review wrong item), (b) check for competitor sabotage patterns (multiple 1-star reviews from new accounts for same product), (c) assess safety-related claims (e.g., &quot;this wiring caused a fire&quot;) — escalate to Category Manager, (d) check for pricing discrepancies in reviews mentioning prices (may reference old prices, causing confusion), (e) approve, reject, or edit (remove specific words)
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Content Moderator
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: 5 min/review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1286_Task9" name="Negative-review response hand-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Negative-review response hand-off: ≤2-star reviews route to the canonical W510 CX response and vendor-response steps (W510 steps 5–6, 48-hour SLA), with quality-pattern escalation per W1311 (steps 2–3); this playbook contributes only the sabotage/safety flags raised in step 2
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1286_Task10" name="Analytics hand-off">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Analytics hand-off: weekly/SKU-level review analytics are owned by W510 (step 7) and W1311 (step 5); this workflow contributes the moderation-outcome metrics — flag rate, false-positive rate, queue depth and time-in-queue — to those reports
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Operations
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: ~30 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1286_Task11" name="Content seeding for new products">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Content seeding for new products: For new product launches: (a) Ecommerce Operations identifies 10–20 loyal customers per category for early review invitations, (b) offers small incentive (loyalty bonus points) for verified purchase reviews, (c) ensures new products have ≥3 reviews within 30 days of launch, (d) monitors for early quality feedback to feed back to Category Manager
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Operations
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours/launch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1286_Task12" name="Q&amp;A management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Q&amp;A management: Customer product questions on ecommerce: (a) system routes questions to appropriate Department Supervisor or Category Manager based on product category, (b) Subject matter expert answers within 48 hours, (c) answers published on product page for future customer reference, (d) common Q&amp;A incorporated into product description for continuous improvement
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor / Category Manager
Accountable (A): Ecommerce Operations
Duration: 10 min/question</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1286_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1286_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1286_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1286_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-269 (ensure controlled execution — Ecommerce Platform Operations (PA-10.1).) | - operational: Ecommerce Content Moderator review and approval gate
Owner: Ecommerce Content Moderator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1286_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1286_Annotation14" targetRef="W1286_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
