    <bpmn:process id="W_W1359" name="W1359. Ecommerce Promotional Price Sync, Markdown Conflict Resolution &amp; POS Price Parity Verification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New promotional pricing created in ERP merchandising module; or ecommerce platform price sync discrepancy detected
Frequency: Continuous sync; ~6 major promotional events/year + 10–20 monthly hot deals + ad-hoc flash sales
Volume: 35,000 active SKUs subject to promotional pricing; ~500–2,000 SKUs on promotion at any given time
Owner: Pricing Analyst
Participants: Pricing Analyst, Ecommerce Manager, Category Manager, IT Integration Support
Source: workflow W1359 — Ecommerce Promotional Price Sync, Markdown Conflict Resolution &amp; POS Price Parity Verification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1359_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1359_Lane1" name="Pricing Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1359_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
